# MEETX — line-ending policy.
#
# Without this file the repository mixes CRLF (written by Git's autocrlf on
# checkout) with LF (written by the Node tooling in tools/), which is what
# produced files with MIXED endings. Pinning every text file to LF keeps the
# working tree, the index and CI identical on Windows, macOS and Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
